<title>UK: ABB prices $150 mln convertible bond due 2004.</title>
<headline>ABB prices $150 mln convertible bond due 2004.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond has been priced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABB INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     2.75	MATURITY   *10.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    10.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	PREMIUM    21.82 PCT SPREAD	=</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLALE AFTER YEAR THREE.</p>
<p>		CONVERTIBLE INTO EXISTING SHARES OF ABB AG</p>
<p>		CNV PRICE  2,701.89 SFR, FOREX FIX 1.432 SFR/US$</p>
<p>		5.3 SHARES PER BOND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
